Key Design Featured
APIM sits outside AKS: uses Azure Private DNS to resolve *.apps.internal.local → NGINX Internal LB IP
NGINX is the TLS termination boundary for north-south traffic (APIM → cluster)
Istio (AKS addon) handles east-west mTLS between microservices transparently
Envoy iptables intercept: all pod traffic redirected through istio-proxy on ports 15001/15006
SPIFFE identities (spiffe://cluster.local/ns/<ns>/sa/<sa>) used for zero-trust AuthorizationPolicy
.NET trace header propagation code included so distributed tracing works across services
